    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a young British servicewoman in profile, her side cap tilted and her hair pinned in a bun, set against a backdrop of faded handwritten letters. Her gaze is distant, her expression still — a portrait of a woman with a letter half-written in her head. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
