    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of an American infantryman advancing with his rifle at the ready, his M1 steel helmet low and his pack heavy on his back, an entrenching tool at his hip. He moves along a quiet street, eyes fixed on the corner ahead — a portrait of the advance, and the listening that comes with it. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
