    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of an American military policeman, the letters MP painted bold across his M1 steel helmet, his round glasses catching the light and a rifle standing upright at his shoulder. He looks off down the yard, stern and watchful — the portrait of the man who keeps the order behind the lines. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
