    "title": "Stirring the Pot",
    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of field cooks at work around a great steaming pot, one man in his tank top smiling at the camera with the ladle in his hand, his mates beside him in the open-air kitchen. Steam rises from the pot and the wooden crate waits at their feet — a portrait of the meal that keeps the company going. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
    "alt": "Painterly World War II portrait of soldiers cooking in a field kitchen around a large steaming pot, one smiling at the camera holding a ladle.",
    "buyLink": "https://wayne-heim.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/WWII/Portraits/Color/i-CMNk3QP/A",

