    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a Red Cross nurse tending a wounded German soldier, her hands at the bandages wrapped around his head, the white cloth bright against his gray-green uniform. She works with quiet care, and he watches her hands — a portrait of the dressing that holds a man together. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
